# Claude Code. The agent definitions in .claude/agents/ ARE tracked — they are
# project config and useful to anyone working here. These two are not:
#   settings.local.json  per-machine permissions, not a project decision
#   agent-memory/        working notes an agent writes for itself, including
#                        candid internal feedback on our own work. This repo is
#                        public, so it must not go in (same reason /proposals/
#                        is ignored).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/agent-memory/
